title: Cost the Programme
subtitle: Every faction supports arithmetic until the arithmetic reaches its promise.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_party_card
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_cost_programme_timer <= 0 and (budget_promises > 0 or budget_breaches > 0 or social_floor_written = 1 or fiscal_stress >= 10)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_cost_programme_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/deck_party.svg

= Cost the Programme

Economists have attached numbers to the manifesto. Not all of the numbers fit
inside the same budget, especially after concessions to coalition partners.
December will expose any fiction that survives this meeting.

- @independent_office
- @trim_promises
- @name_the_taxes

@independent_office
title: Fund an independent costing office
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Trustworthy arithmetic reduces one existing breach.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Independent modelling and publication cost two resources.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 2;
Q.public_trust += 4;
Q.labor_credibility += 3;
Q.media_capacity += 1;
Q.barons_dissent += 2;
Q.workers_support += 1;
Q.turnout_readiness += 2;
if (Q.budget_breaches > 0) {
    Q.budget_breaches -= 1;
}
Q.news_headline = "Independent costings survive the factional meeting";
!}

The office publishes assumptions, ranges and trade-offs that no caucus can
quietly rewrite. The programme becomes harder to attack and less pleasant to
promise.

- #poland_card_finish

@trim_promises
title: Remove promises that cannot survive a budget vote
subtitle: Credibility rises as activists watch their priorities disappear.
choose-if: budget_promises > 0 or budget_breaches > 0
unavailable-subtitle: There is no unfunded promise or recorded budget breach to remove.
on-arrival: {!
Q.public_trust += 2;
Q.party_unity -= 2;
Q.left_poll -= 0.1;
Q.razem_dissent += 4;
Q.spring_dissent += 2;
Q.labor_dissent += 2;
Q.turnout_readiness -= 2;
if (Q.budget_breaches > 0) {
    Q.budget_breaches -= 1;
}
if (Q.budget_promises > 0) {
    Q.budget_promises -= 1;
}
Q.news_headline = "The Left removes promises before the budget removes them";
!}

The revised document can plausibly be financed. Every deleted line has a
constituency, a spokesperson and a screenshot of the original commitment.

- #poland_card_finish

@name_the_taxes
title: Say openly who will pay more
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. A coherent redistributive case creates liberal and old-guard enemies.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Building and defending the tax case requires one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; labor_credibility += 4; razem_cooperation += 4; razem_dissent -= 3; public_trust += 1; budget_promises += 1; ko_relation -= 4; barons_dissent += 4; media_capacity += 1; workers_support += 3; young_support += 2; rural_support -= 1; pensioner_support -= 1; news_headline = "The Left attaches taxes to its promises"

Higher capital and top-income taxation are presented beside the services they
fund. The argument is finally coherent. Business-friendly allies no longer
have to imagine what a coalition with the Left might cost them.

- #poland_card_finish
